        "text": "sacflow lists 40 MCP tools, including get_ai_agents_handover_reasons, get_ai_agents_lost_reasons, get_ai_agents_report, get_ai_agents_series, get_attachment, get_contact, get_contacts_report, get_current_user, get_organization, get_organizations_report, get_outbounds_report, and get_period_report."
      }
    },
